## OpenCV Zoo Pre-trained Models

The stream-highlights mode can optionally use pre-trained ONNX models from OpenCV Zoo. These models are downloaded separately via `python3 scripts/fetch_models.py` with SHA-256 verification and are not included in this repository.

### YuNet Face Detection Model

- **Model**: face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
- **Source**: https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet
- **License**: MIT License
- **Copyright**: Copyright (c) 2021 OpenCV
- **Purpose**: Facecam detection for smart crop positioning

